// Ruins to send parties to, each in a region (regions.json5): seen once the region is known.
//   tier        1-3 (4-5 arrive in W4b), on the base-tier colour scale for the marker
//   minutes     the trip there and back
//   party       most survivors that can go (regions.json5 rules cap it too)
//   chance      base success chance in percent, before the party's levels, traits and gear
//   hazard      hostile, blocked, unstable or flooded: which traits and gear help
//   injury      percent chance each member comes back hurt (doubled on a failure)
//   injuryHours how long an injury takes to heal, before medics and treatment
//   rations     paid when the party leaves
//   rolls       loot rolls on a success (half of them on a partial success)
//   loot        weighted rolls, like barrels; blueprint / fragment: percent chances on a success
//   xp          per member on a success (half on a partial, a quarter on a failure)
// Names, blurbs and the report lines are in the locale (`site.{id}.*`, `story.{id}.*`).
